# Frontend environment — copy to .env.local (git-ignored) and fill in.
#
# The API key the client sends as the `X-API-Key` header. It must match the
# MASSIVE_API_KEY the backend is running with.
#
# There is deliberately NO default and no hardcoded fallback: a credential
# baked into client source ships to every browser that loads the app. If this
# is unset the client logs a warning and the API answers 401/503.
#
# Note: anything in a VITE_* variable is embedded in the production bundle and
# is therefore PUBLIC. Never put a production API key here — serve the real
# key from a backend session/proxy instead.
VITE_MASSIVE_API_KEY=
